WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,800
I'll tell the girl to get up

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,800
Don't bother to admire me

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:12,140
Madam

4
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:14,580
Will something happen?

5
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:16,250
That smile of the prince

6
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:18,010
It makes my heart tremble when I see it

7
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:19,010
what could happen

8
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:20,010
Just watch

9
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:21,730
That unsatisfactory daughter of yours

10
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:22,930
I’m afraid I’ve used Wu Shan

11
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:25,130
So he left with them willingly

12
00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:31,540
I never have any weakness

13
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:34,610
I have never felt as worried as I am.

14
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:39,060
Now I'm starting to covet the way she looks at me

15
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:41,940
I don’t want her to look at anyone else again
